description=Telegram bot for rooted Android (ZTE F50). 12-language UI. Cep çakısı: cell-tools (/spectrum, /imsi_watch, /locate), sms-cmd (/sms_cmd offline SMS), tor-relay (/tor bridge). + status/AT/shell/perf/IMEI/SMS/wifi/network/power/scheduling/tailscale/speedtest/update/install_module/sha256 verify. Requires bin-utils v1.3.0+.
